-Data & SaaS Security: consists of network data loss protection (DLP), which ensures visibility and protection of data (data loss/
-exfiltration) in transit across networks. The inline CASB service, secures SaaS applications in use, providing broad visibility and
-granular control over SaaS access, usage, and data.
-Attack Surface Visibility and Compliance: The FortiGuard Attack Surface Security Service provides continuous, compliance-
-ready monitoring of your Fortinet Security Fabric infrastructure. It calculates your overall security posture rating by scoring
-controls against vulnerabilities, misconfigurations, and sub-optimal settings and offers remediation guidelines for compliance.
-Full visibility, facilitated through the Security Fabric, extends to IoT devices, where the service automates discovery,
-segmentation, and enforcement to effectively reduce the attack surface.
-Zero-day protection: available on all NGFWs. Inline malware prevention (ILMPS), included in the Enterprise Protection bundle or
